            -- market_loop.lua (NodeHub Market) - AUTO Claim Booth + Auto Unlist/List dari STATE.main.auto_market.list
-- ✅ Source of truth: _G.STATE.main.auto_market (runtime MAP)
-- ✅ Unlist pakai: TradeEvents.Booths.RemoveListing:InvokeServer(listingUUID)
-- ✅ List pakai  : TradeEvents.Booths.CreateListing:InvokeServer(itemType, itemId, price)
-- ✅ Claim booth : TradeEvents.Booths.ClaimBooth:FireServer(boothInstance) (ambil booth kosong)
-- ✅ WEBHOOK SOLD / BUY:
--    - hook: TradeEvents.Booths.AddToHistory.OnClientEvent
--    - Sold: status ~= Failed AND seller.userId == LocalPlayer
--    - Buy : status ~= Failed AND buyer.userId  == LocalPlayer
--    - dedupe by log.id
--    - payload include: itemName, uuid, price, buyer/seller, finishTime, itemType, kg/baseKg/muts
--
-- Referensi data pet:
--   - PetListView.listPetsNotFav()        -> {uuid, ptype, age, kg, ...}
--   - PetListView.listPetsListedBooth()   -> {uuid, listingUUID, price, itemType, ...}
--
-- Catatan:
-- - "Mode A" di MK.list key = UUID pet
-- - "Mode F" di MK.fruitList key = UUID holdable (manual)
-- - "Mode FA" di MK.fruitList key = FA|fruitName|kgSigned (rule KG)
-- - "Mode FB" di MK.fruitList key = FB|fruitName (rule price)
-- - "Mode B" di MK.list key = ruleId pet (petType|min|max); pilih UUID pet NotFav yang cocok rule KG
-- - Prioritas booth: Pet A > Pet B > Fruit F > Fruit FA > Fruit FB > Skin S
-- - KG signed:
--      kg == 0  -> bebas
--      kg > 0   -> pilih pet dengan kgNow >= kg
--      kg < 0   -> pilih pet dengan kgNow <= abs(kg)

